id: 23
hanzi: 工程师
pinyin: gōng chéng shī
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: engineer (professional technical designer)
  es: ingeniero; técnica/o superior

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a person trained in the design, construction, and use of engines, machines, software, or structures | profesional cualificado que aplica principios científicos para diseñar, construir y operar obras, máquinas o programas | 资深软件架构工程师 (senior software architect engineer)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 桥梁工程师和施工人员在悬崖深谷间连续奋战了数月，终于成功合龙了这座特大悬索桥。 | Qiáoliáng gōngchéngshī hé shīgōng rényuán zài xuányá shēngǔ jiān liánxù fènzhàn le shù yuè, zhōngyú chénggōng hélóng le zhè zuò tìdà xuánsuǒqiáo. | Bridge engineers and construction workers fought for months across the deep cliffside chasm, finally joining the spans of this mega suspension bridge. | Los ingenieros de puentes y operarios bregaron durante meses en el desfiladero hasta completar el ensamblaje final del monumental puente colgante.
  #2 | 优秀的航空工程师在设计客机外壳时，对每一个部件的气动阻力都进行了极为精密严苛的模拟风洞计算。 | Yōuxiù de hángkōng gōngchéngshī zài shèjì kèjī wàiké shí, duì měi yí ge bùjiàn de qìdòng zǔlì dōu jìnxíng le jíwéi jīngmì yánkē de mónǐ fēngdòng jìsuàn. | Distinguished aeronautical engineers perform rigorous wind-tunnel simulations on the aerodynamic drag of every component when designing passenger planes. | Los ingenieros aeronáuticos realizan rigurosos cálculos aerodinámicos en túneles de viento para optimizar cada pieza del fuselaje.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
