  高级工程师 | senior engineer

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  匠心独运 | jiàng xīn dú yùn | displaying wonderful ingenuity; singular craftsmanship
  精雕细刻 | jīng diāo xì kè | carve with fine precision; meticulous craftsmanship
  开山架桥 | kāi shān jià qiáo | level mountains and build bridges; clear obstacles boldly
  革故鼎新 | gé gù dǐng xīn | overthrow the old and usher in the new; innovate boldly

character_decomposition[3]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  工 | gōng | work; craft; engineering | obra; técnica; ingeniería | 工 | work / craft | carpenter's plumb square | 工 (gōng) | 3 | 单一结构 | A carpenter's square tool; represents engineering, craftsmanship, and structured construction. | A carpenter's level square (工) measuring structural angles for precision craft. | Una escuadra de carpintero (工) guiando trazos precisos en la construcción. | 55 | M | 工
  程 | chéng | order; rule; measure; journey | proceso; medida; trayecto | 禾 | grain | 禾 (grain measurement) + 呈 (display / present) | 呈 (chéng / phonetic) | 12 | 左右结构 | Grain radical 禾 beside 呈; weighing grain standards to establish official measurement rules and systematic workflows. | Weighing stalks of golden grain (禾) on an official presentation tray (呈) to establish orderly standards (程). | Pesar espigas de cereal (禾) en una balanza oficial (呈) fijando normas metódicas (程). | 35 | HDRHG | 程
  师 | shī | master; teacher; expert; army | maestro; perito; experto | 巾 | cloth / towel | 帀 (circling troops banner) + 巾 (standard cloth) | 师 (shī) | 6 | 左右结构 | A commander holding military banners before troops; evolved into revered masters, mentors, and certified professionals. | A revered master raising the banner of knowledge (巾) to instruct apprentices (师). | Un maestro que alza el estandarte de la pericia (巾) guiando a sus discípulos (师). | 55 | HLMLB | 師

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: A master (师) who applies technical standards (程) to construction works (工) is a qualified engineer (工程师).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Un perito acreditado (师) que aplica procesos metódicos (程) a las obras (工) es un ingeniero (工程师).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Title combining modern technical methodology with historical reverence for masters of craft (师徒制).
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Three syllables: 'gōng chéng shī' (55-35-55). High level tone on 'gōng', rising on 'chéng', and sustaining high on 'shī'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    程 | chéng | order; journey | Grain radical 禾 on left with 呈
    呈 | chéng | present; display | Without the grain radical on left
    师 | shī | master; teacher | Has 刂-like vertical and 巾
    帅 | shuài | commander; handsome | Has a top stroke  丿 on left
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    工 | gōng | worker; artisan
    匠 | jiàng | craftsman; artisan
    家 | jiā | specialist; expert
    员 | yuán | member; personnel

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 工程师 denotes an educated professional applying science and mathematics to practical design and systems.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 工程师 vs. 工人 | gōngrén | 工人 denotes manual labor execution on the production line, while 工程师 formulates blueprints, software architectures, and mathematical designs.
    2 | 工程师 vs. 科学家 | kēxuéjiā | 科学家 pursues pure theoretical truth and discovery, whereas 工程师 translates those scientific discoveries into functional commercial products.
    3 | 工程师 vs. 技师 | jìshī | 技师 focuses on practical operational maintenance and machine adjustment, while 工程师 oversees systemic system design.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 航天工程师团队在深空探测领域攻坚克难。他们凭借务实的科学作风与精益求精的工匠情怀，将探测器精准送达预定轨道，让飞天梦想在浩瀚星空中璀璨绽放。 | Hángtiān gōngchéngshī tuánduì zài shēnkōng tàncè lǐngyù gōngjiān-kènán. Tāmen píngjiè wùshí de kēxué zuòfēng yǔ jīngyìqiújīng de gōngjiàng qínghuái, jiāng tàncèqì jīngzhǔn sòngdá yùdìng guǐdào, ràng fēitiān mèngxiǎng zài hàohàn xīngkōng zhōng cuǐcàn zhànfàng. | Aerospace engineers have overcome challenges in deep space exploration. With scientific pragmatism and meticulous craftsmanship, they delivered orbiters onto precision paths, realizing ancient dreams. | Los ingenieros aeroespaciales superaron grandes hitos espaciales. Con rigor pragmático y esmero artesanal, situaron las sondas en órbita con precisión, materializando el sueño de surcar el cosmos.
  #2 | 面对取球难题，工程师起初设计了复杂的滑轮装置试图倾倒皮球。然而实践证明，精密图纸反倒不如一把普通锯子直截了当。顶尖的工程智慧，恰恰体现在大道至简之中。 | Miànduì qǔ qiú nántí, gōngchéngshī qǐchū shèjì le fùzá de huálún zhuāngzhì shìtú qīngdào píqiú. Rán'ér shíjiàn zhèngmíng, jīngmì túzhǐ fǎndào bùrú yì bǎ pǔtōng jùzi zhíjié-liǎodàng. Dǐngjiān de gōngchéng zhìhuì, qiàqià tǐxiàn zài dàdào-zhìjiǎn zhīzhōng. | Faced with extracting balls, engineers initially devised complex pulleys to tilt baskets. Yet practice proved intricate designs inferior to an ordinary saw. Supreme engineering brilliance lies in radical simplicity. | Para vaciar las canastas, los ingenieros idearon poleas complejas. Mas la práctica demostró que una modesta sierra superaba a planos sofisticados. La verdadera maestría técnica reside en la sencillez.
